# አጋጣሚ is seeded, so the same ዘር repeats exactly (§8.3). This case asserts
# properties, not particular numbers: the numbers belong to an implementation,
# the properties belong to the language.
# expect: እውነት
# expect: እውነት
# expect: እውነት
# expect: 4
ዘር(፩)
ሀ = አጋጣሚ(1፣ 6)
ለ = አጋጣሚ(1፣ 6)

ዘር(1)
ሐ = አጋጣሚ(1፣ 6)
መ = አጋጣሚ(1፣ 6)

# The same seed gives the same sequence.
ጻፍ(ሀ == ሐ እና ለ == መ)

# Both ends are included, so አጋጣሚ(1፣ 6) is a die.
ጻፍ(ሀ >= 1 እና ሀ <= 6)

# A single-value range is the only draw whose value is the language's business.
ጻፍ(አጋጣሚ(4፣ 4) == 4)
ጻፍ(አጋጣሚ(4፣ 4))
